"value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4353940","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4264060-1846651706692963","game_id":"steam-4264060","kind":"announcement","title":"Town of Tinysville + Steam Next Fest","summary":"Hello my fellow mayors!As Town of Tinysville begins to wrap up development, we've entered our final event before the game's release on December 4!Here's what to expect in the full version:12 Towns, each with their own distinct shapes and constraints7 Difficulty Levels that make it even harder to make Mr. Mayor happy24 Buildings36 Laws120 Landmarks254 Total Cards to discoverChill soundtrack by 7Seven Studios (Louis DiGiorno)Endless Mode for an even harder challenge. Go above and beyond!Limitless ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T22:41:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692963","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4264060-1845383656391630","game_id":"steam-4264060","kind":"announcement","title":"Town of Tinysville Releases December 4!","summary":"Hello my fellow mayors!I'm so excited to announce that every main feature for v1.0.0 of Town of Tinysville is done and Town of Tinysville is planned to release on December 4th!!Here's every feature coming in the release:12 Towns, each with their own distinct shapes and constraints7 Difficulty Levels that make it even harder to make Mr. Mayor happy24 Buildings36 Laws120 Landmarks254 Total Cards to discoverChill soundtrack by 7Seven Studios (Louis DiGiorno)Endless Mode for an even harder challenge","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T16:35:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656391630","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4264060-1840310314341874","game_id":"steam-4264060","kind":"announcement","title":"TINY TEAMS + FREE KEYS + IMPORTANT NEWS","summary":"As we get closer to launch, here's what to expect from the 1.0 release:240+ Cards120 Landmarks12 Towns7 DistrictsNEW Endless Mode!After 1.0 there's gonna be TONS of content updates which will introduce daily challenges, more landmarks, exclusive holiday maps and a global leaderboard!FREE KEYS!Similar to the other events, I'll be running a giveaway for 5 free game keys. This is a limited drop for early supporters and players checking out the demo during the festival. All keys will be awarded on t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T13:10:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314341874","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4264060-1839041357023983","game_id":"steam-4264060","kind":"announcement","title":"STATE OF THE GAME - July 2026","summary":"Hello my fellow mayors! As another month passes, Town of Tinysville is closer to its launch than ever before! Here's what's been happening the past 30 days of developmentTons of Upcoming Festivals!As of today, Town of Tinysville will be participating in 3 upcoming festivals! (Could possibly be more)Tiny TeamsBest Indie Games Fall ShowcaseOctober Next FestLandmarks! Landmarks! Landmarks!New landmarks everywhere! Most of the development in the past month has gone towards new landmarks to add more ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-22T13:43:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357023983","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4264060-1835871199313631","game_id":"steam-4264060","kind":"announcement","title":"STATE OF THE GAME - June 2026","summary":"Hello my fellow mayors! As Town of Tinysville surpasses a year of development, I wanted to let you know the future of the game as we get close to the full release.Planned Release Date: Q1 2027Planned Features:12 Towns7 Districts132 Landmarks254 Total Cards48 Achievements...And so much more planned!I expect to update the game regularly, with endless mode in the near horizon, DLC, and hopefully extra language and platform support. Thank you to everyone who has supported the development so far.Here","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-22T17:45:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199313631","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4264060-1833968530895583","game_id":"steam-4264060","kind":"update","title":"DEMO Patch 2.1.1","summary":"Okay, I know I said the last one was the final update but this is the REAL final update for the demo. I have a bunch of QoL changes and bug fixes lined up. Here's the full list:QoL:-You can now see your estimated coins while in the shop-The music loops more closely now with less gaps of silence in between-Updated the description of various chance / chaos cards for better clarity.-Buildings now say \"Crumbled!\" when crumbling-Updated font for better readability-Added high resolution font as an opt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-31T16:23:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530895583","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4264060-1833968530890003","game_id":"steam-4264060","kind":"announcement","title":"STRATEGEMS + FREE KEYS","summary":"I’m excited to announce that Town of Tinysville has been selected to participate in the 2026 Strategems Fest. I’ll be running a small giveaway for 5 free game keys. This is a limited drop for early supporters and players checking out the demo during the festival. These keys are in the same pool as the keys from the Deckbuilders Fest. All keys will be awarded on the game's launch.How do I enter?Step 1: WISHLIST Town of TinysvilleStep 2: Fill out this short Google Form with your Steam username and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T03:24:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530890003","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4264060-1832065502820251","game_id":"steam-4264060","kind":"update","title":"FINAL DEMO UPDATE - 2.1.0","summary":"As the Deckbuilders Fest concludes, I've gotten a bunch of feedback from players. I've also decided this will be the final content update until the game's release. Small patches will still be rolled out, but any major changes will be unveiled in the full release.Rebalances-Revamped the 'Magic License' law to increase your max special hand size-Buffed 'The Orb' to give a chance card every day instead of every 3 days-Buffed 'The Statue'-Buffed 'The Spa'-Reworked school buildings to actually make t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-11T02:34:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502820251","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4264060-1832065502812204","game_id":"steam-4264060","kind":"update","title":"PATCH 2.0.6","summary":"Town of Tinysville just got a small update in response to feedback from the Deckbuilders Fest. Patch 2.0.6 includes new / rebalanced landmarks, quality of life changes, better performance, and a few bug fixes.Gameplay:-Upgrade cards are now double the price, but have 2 uses insead of 1. This allows for better usage since special card slots are limited.-Changed the behaviour of several landmarks-Added 4 new landmarks-Rebalanced chance card distribution in the shopQoL:-Made water tiles darker for ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-07T14:03:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502812204","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4264060-1831432155578530","game_id":"steam-4264060","kind":"announcement","title":"DECKBUILDERS FEST + FREE KEYS","summary":"I’m excited to announce that Town of Tinysville has been selected to participate in the 2026 Deckbuilders Fest. This is a huge milestone for the game, and I wanted to do something special to celebrate it.I’ll be running a small giveaway for 5 free game keys. This is a limited drop for early supporters and players checking out the demo during the festival.If you’re interested in getting a copy ahead of release, keep an eye below for details on how to enter.How do I enter?Step 1: WISHLIST Town of ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T19:52:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155578530","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4264060-1830797770240393","game_id":"steam-4264060","kind":"announcement","title":"Town of Tinysville DEMO 2.0.0 + Cloud Saves + Deckbuilders Fest 2026","summary":"With the Steam Deckbuilding Fest right around the corner, Town of Tinysville has undergone some massive changes!TL;DR-Massive overhaul for the core gameplay mechanics-Achievements-Steam Cloud Saving-Deckbuilders Fest 2026The default branch of Town of Tinysville has been updated and now uses a new save file. If you want to use your old save file, go into Properties > Game Versions > then select \"Old Version\"Main Features:The Deck:Instead of buying new cards every day, cards bought from the card s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-26T15:56:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770240393","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4264060-1825727806715374","game_id":"steam-4264060","kind":"update","title":"Town of Tinysville DEMO PATCH 1.2","summary":"Another QoL is coming to Town of Tinysville on 3/1/26.Main Features-Updated Graphics and UI Say goodbye to the simple black background and the all-green UI. All towns are now actual islands with flowing water. This makes new water-based buildings possible in the future. Keep an eye out! The right side UI also got some extra color and updated text for better readability and clarity.-Landmark RarityWhile landmarks were previously weighted, they are now weighted by rarity as opposed to numbers. The","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-01T15:15:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806715374","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4264060-1825093633190606","game_id":"steam-4264060","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch v1.1","summary":"It's been a little over a week since the launch of the Town of Tinysville Demo and there has been a ton of player feedback. This patch adds a significant amount of QoL changes, bug fixes, and landmark rebalancing.Main Features:-Updated Collection PanelThe Collection menu ha